<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">02092026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran has closed the Strait of Hormuz, and two tankers were attacked as they left it.</s> <s>The waterway carried one in every five barrels of the world's oil before the closure, and it's now shut not by blockade but by insurance — no underwriter will price a hull that might not come back.</s> <s>American strikes hit Revolutionary Guard positions overnight, Tehran fired missiles at bases in Jordan, and the oil-importing economies of Asia will pay first.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iran's General Staff says American jets struck its southern coast at Chabahar and Konarak, and has vowed what it calls crushing revenge.</s> <s>Only Tehran confirms these strikes, and only Washington confirms its own — in the first phase of an exchange like this, every casualty figure is a claim by a belligerent until someone neutral reaches the ground.</s> <s>The Revolutionary Guards say a wedding party was among those hit, and no independent body has yet been able to look.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The World Food Programme is halving its West Bank operation, cutting rations for four hundred thousand people.</s> <s>Access didn't close this time — the money did, and that distinction matters, because under the Fourth Geneva Convention Israel as the occupying power owes the civilian population support regardless of what donors in Rome decide to give.</s> <s>Humanitarian aid is discretionary money doing the work of a legal obligation, and the agency says it needs three hundred and eighty-six million dollars more within six months.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Gaza, the public grid hasn't delivered electricity since October of two thousand twenty-three, so every hospital, bakery and water pump now runs on private generators.</s> <s>That power costs roughly nine dollars a kilowatt-hour... perhaps a hundred times what a household elsewhere pays, and a dry cleaner in Nuseirat has sold his last machine to keep buying it.</s> <s>Drone strikes killed four Palestinians in Gaza City this week, two of them children.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hakainde Hichilema was sworn in for a second term in Lusaka while his main challenger sat in detention on a treason charge.</s> <s>Zambia's courts were shut in the days before the vote, closing the route to any legal challenge — and Hichilema himself was jailed on treason as the opposition candidate before he won in two thousand twenty-one.</s> <s>Mundubile now faces trial on the same charge, which says less about either man than about an instrument that keeps changing hands.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Joshua Wong has pleaded guilty in Hong Kong to colluding with foreign forces, a charge that carries life imprisonment.</s> <s>Wong has already spent more than two thousand days in custody, and national security cases there are heard without a jury by judges the chief executive selects, with bail denied by default — a system that removes the value of contesting anything.</s> <s>That collusion clause is the exportable part, and drafts of it now sit in security bills from Southeast Asia to the Gulf.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Leaked emails from an Elbit Systems executive detail years of Israeli Hermes drone sales to Uganda's intelligence services and special forces.</s> <s>They've surfaced exactly as Kampala prepares to send troops to a stabilization force in Gaza — meaning the army asked to police Palestinians bought its aerial surveillance from the state that besieged them.</s> <s>Arms exports are how one government converts another's troop commitment into a standing dependency, and a leak is the only reason any of this is public.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Asked about British defence spending, Donald Trump said the American position on the Falklands is one of many now under review.</s> <s>Washington has recognised British administration of the islands without taking a sovereignty stance since the war of nineteen eighty-two, and that position costs nothing to hold — which is precisely what makes it useful as leverage.</s> <s>Thirty-six hundred islanders and Argentina, a party to the dispute that wasn't in the room, are now inside someone else's budget negotiation.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A judge in Quito is weighing whether seven suspects will stand trial for the assassination of Fernando Villavicencio.</s> <s>Villavicencio was an investigative journalist turned presidential candidate, shot dead while campaigning in two thousand twenty-three, and the men accused of ordering it are not street gunmen.</s> <s>A conviction would be the first time Ecuador's state has held its own political-criminal elite to account.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Sun Pharma, India's largest drugmaker, has agreed to give American Medicaid programmes its lowest price anywhere in the world.</s> <s>Differential pricing is the mechanism that's kept Indian generics affordable across Africa and South Asia — but if Washington is contractually owed the global minimum, then every discount offered to a buyer in Nigeria or Bangladesh now costs the company that same discount on its largest volume.</s> <s>The rational response is to stop offering the low price at all.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nepal has declared its trekking trails open with about four and a half thousand people still missing.</s> <s>Tourism supplies most of the country's foreign-exchange earnings outside remittances, and guides and lodge owners earn a year's income in ten autumn weeks — so a state with no fiscal buffer must announce normality before it has finished counting its dead.</s> <s>Rescuers are still working the same valleys the booking desks are now advertising.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's pump prices rose again on Tuesday even though Brent crude fell four percent in the week before.</s> <s>A fixed tax of one hundred and fourteen rupees a litre sits on top of every litre regardless of what oil does, which is why diesel still trades above its pre-war level of two hundred and eighty-one rupees after peaking at five hundred and twenty in April.</s> <s>Daily resets don't help when the largest single component of the price never moves.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The <sub alias="Securities and Exchange Commission">SEC</sub> has proposed rewriting the rules for transfer agents — the firms that hold the authoritative record of who owns a share.</s> <s>Every tokenisation scheme is ultimately one claim: that a blockchain entry, not a regulated intermediary's book, is the real register, and the same regulator is separately weighing round-the-clock trading with Nasdaq and Citadel Securities on the seventeenth of September.</s> <s>Both questions remove the overnight window in which the American settlement system finds and unwinds its own errors.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>China's installed solar capacity reached one thousand two hundred and eighty-six gigawatts by July, passing coal as the country's largest source of generating capacity.</s> <s>Coal still produces far more actual electricity, because capacity rates a panel at noon under clear sky and rates a coal plant at whatever it's asked to deliver — the gap between those two numbers is what a multi-trillion-yuan grid programme is meant to close.</s> <s>Transmission and storage decide when the milestone becomes a reduction in what gets burned.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Inspectors from the International Atomic Energy Agency have confirmed that the building Israel bombed at Deir ez-Zor was an undeclared nuclear reactor.</s> <s>Confirmation arrived nineteen years after the strike, which was carried out on intelligence that was never shown — verification needs years of ground access and a bomber needs none.</s> <s>A finding this late can describe what was there, but it can't retroactively supply authority the strike didn't have.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ebola has now infected more than six thousand people in the Democratic Republic of Congo, with deaths approaching three thousand.</s> <s>Government figures put the fatality rate near forty-eight percent, and containment means tracing every contact within days across six provinces already strained by armed conflict.</s> <s>No vaccine or treatment yet works against this particular species of the virus.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>American health officials recorded two measles deaths reported by Pennsylvania, then set the national count to zero, then removed it from the website entirely.</s> <s>States, not Washington, certify causes of death — so the federal number was never the evidence, only the tally of it, and the health secretary has publicly disputed measles mortality.</s> <s>Meanwhile the Orion capsule's heat shield came back from its last flight with nine charred sites instead of more than a hundred, after NASA changed the reentry path rather than the shield.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Chinese commercial cargo ships are gathering signals intelligence along their ordinary trading routes, according to a new report.</s> <s>A dedicated spy vessel costs a navy a hull, a crew and a diplomatic incident, while a container ship is already going there, already loitering at anchor, and already bristling with antennas nobody questions.</s> <s>The collection is passive and the platform is civilian, so neither espionage law nor port-state inspection reaches it — there's no rule to break, which is exactly why it scales.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A China-linked group researchers call Fire Ant has turned compromised Cisco routers into launchpads for further attacks.</s> <s>Network hardware is the trust layer everything above it assumes is honest, and a router breach survives after every single device it serves has been cleaned.</s> <s>Cleaning the wrong layer perfectly leaves you exactly where you started.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Anthropic shipped two frontier models on the same day this week — and we should disclose that this newsroom's own pipeline runs on Anthropic models.</s> <s>Labs now release on a timescale shorter than any procurement cycle, so a ministry or a hospital that spends six months evaluating a system deploys something two generations old on the day it goes live.</s> <s>That gap is widest where the buyer is a state with no independent capacity to evaluate at all.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Just thirty percent of South African news outlets block <sub alias="A I">AI</sub> crawlers, barely up from twenty-nine percent last December.</s> <s>Small and vernacular publishers can't refuse the crawlers without losing the search visibility they depend on to exist — the choice is only real for outlets big enough to survive being invisible.</s> <s>Separately, one engineer has gone back and graded a prominent AI sceptic's predictions one by one, which almost nobody in this argument ever submits to, because commentary written in prose without dates or thresholds can't be proven wrong by anyone.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>